WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,610 --> 00:00:04,850
How dare you steal openly?

2
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:05,930
What is Su Jin doing?

3
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:07,330
Can't you see such a big thief?

4
00:00:07,730 --> 00:00:09,530
Customer over there, please wait a moment

5
00:00:09,530 --> 00:00:11,470
Who are you talking to?

6
00:00:11,470 --> 00:00:12,900
Hurry up and check out

7
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,540
Otherwise, I will complain to the store manager about you.

8
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:16,380
Sorry customer, please wait.

9
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:18,700
I'll catch a thief first

10
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:19,660
Where is the thief?

11
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:22,310
Guest, where are you going? You haven't paid the bill yet.

12
00:00:22,310 --> 00:00:23,910
You are stealing

13
00:00:23,910 --> 00:00:26,270
I was touched by this human being

14
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:27,310
she can see me

15
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:29,670
This human being can see the invisibility and weirdness. Someone stole it.

16
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:31,110
I almost walked out of the store

17
00:00:31,110 --> 00:00:32,310
I was just arranging it without realizing it

18
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:34,750
I almost stepped into the gate of hell

19
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:35,910
This old player

20
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:37,430
Not only can you see the invisible and weird

21
00:00:37,430 --> 00:00:39,150
It can actually make the other party reveal itself instantly

22
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:41,100
What kind of strength is this?

23
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:42,660
She's revealed now

24
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:44,100
They can all see themselves

25
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:46,740
I'm obviously not showing up, why let me go?

26
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:49,120
I don’t want anything. All the stolen goods.

27
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:51,120
Be sure to stay here otherwise when you count the goods

28
00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:52,860
I'm dead

29
00:00:52,860 --> 00:00:54,660
Everything is here, where is my body?

30
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:55,580
There's still room to hide things

31
00:00:55,580 --> 00:01:01,260
I'm not looking for blame. I didn't expect this thief to be a chuunibyou. But seeing how she behaved, she shouldn't have the guts to lie. Su Jin, please take inventory of the goods.

32
00:01:01,260 --> 00:01:02,980
See if there are fewer store managers

33
00:01:02,980 --> 00:01:04,020
Don't keep customers waiting for a long time

34
00:01:04,020 --> 00:01:05,500
How about you pay them first?

35
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:06,500
Why does he take it for granted?

36
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:07,860
Of course, leave the responsibility of the store clerk to me.

37
00:01:07,860 --> 00:01:10,100
But there won’t be any violations. All the rules are in place.

38
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:11,260
no shortage of things

39
00:01:11,260 --> 00:01:13,300
Since there is no loss, I won’t give it away.

40
00:01:13,300 --> 00:01:22,660
He can definitely increase his strength
